# Sundering Archaic, converge: six mana from Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl and four Mox Jets is three colors (red, white, black), so its
# enters trigger takes a nonland permanent an opponent controls with mana value 3 or less. Refused as its target: Bot2's Hill Giant
# (mana value 4, one over), Bot2's Island (a land) and Bot1's own Mox Ruby. Bot2's Centaur Courser (mana value 3, exactly the
# colors) is exiled, and the Hill Giant and everything else stay.

